; Create cross edges for more complex connectivity (creates dense graph)
(edge v0 v10)
(edge v0 v20)
(edge v0 v30)
(edge v0 v40)
(edge v10 v0)
(edge v10 v20)
(edge v10 v30)
(edge v10 v40)
